    <string name="disclaimer_summary">• 100% Offline: NPCI 123PAY rail with zero internet required.\n• Bank-Grade Security: UPI PIN is entered directly on the call dialer.\n• Strict Privacy: All transaction receipts remain stored on your device.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_text">• 100% Offline (NPCI 123PAY): Netless connects directly to the official 123PAY telephony rail over standard cellular voice. Zero mobile data required.\n\n• Bank-Grade Direct Security: Your secret UPI PIN is entered exclusively on your phone\'s live call keypad. Netless never sees, intercepts, or stores your PIN.\n\n• Strict On-Device Privacy: All transaction records and profiles remain strictly on your local storage. Netless never uploads your financial data.</string>

    
